msgid "ANIMAL_10_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A giant demonic beast with ancient bloodline, fur as hard as iron, causing "
"the ground to shake with every step, with immense strength"

#. animal.csv: Earth Shaking Divine Cow
msgid "ANIMAL_10_NAME"
msgstr "Earth Shaking Divine Cow"

#. animal.csv: A cold-blooded demonic beast living deep in the...
msgid "ANIMAL_11_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A cold-blooded demonic beast living deep in the permafrost, its body "
"composed of translucent bones and frost, silent, able to freeze prey "
"instantly"

#. animal.csv: Ice Spirit Bone Snake
msgid "ANIMAL_11_NAME"
msgstr "Ice Spirit Bone Snake"

#. animal.csv: A spiritual rabbit with a naturally clever temp...
msgid "ANIMAL_1_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A spiritual rabbit with a naturally clever temperament, snow-white fur, "
"containing weak spiritual power, gentle and easy to tame"

#. animal.csv: Spirit Rabbit
msgid "ANIMAL_1_NAME"
msgstr "Spirit Rabbit"

#. animal.csv: A fierce demonic wolf tribe, huge in size, poss...
msgid "ANIMAL_2_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A fierce demonic wolf tribe, huge in size, possessing powerful demonic power"
" and sharp claws and teeth"

#. animal.csv: Demonic Wolf
msgid "ANIMAL_2_NAME"
msgstr "Demonic Wolf"

#. animal.csv: A gentle spiritual beast inhabiting the plains,...
msgid "ANIMAL_3_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A gentle spiritual beast inhabiting the plains, with an all-blue body and "
"jade-like antlers, good at sensing spiritual qi changes"

#. animal.csv: Qingyun Deer
msgid "ANIMAL_3_NAME"
msgstr "Qingyun Deer"

#. animal.csv: An agile hunter in the wild Southern Border, wi...
msgid "ANIMAL_4_DESC"
msgstr ""
"An agile hunter in the wild Southern Border, with a body like a shadow and "
"sharp claws and teeth, skilled at stealth hunting"

#. animal.csv: Shadow Leopard
msgid "ANIMAL_4_NAME"
msgstr "Shadow Leopard"

#. animal.csv: An ancient spiritual beast of the boundless azu...
msgid "ANIMAL_5_DESC"
msgstr ""
"An ancient spiritual beast of the boundless azure sea, with a shell like "
"green jade, able to control seawater, having an extremely long lifespan"

#. animal.csv: Azure Sea Dragon Turtle
msgid "ANIMAL_5_NAME"
msgstr "Azure Sea Dragon Turtle"

#. animal.csv: A strong guardian of the Qingfeng Mountains, wi...
msgid "ANIMAL_6_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A strong guardian of the Qingfeng Mountains, with fur as hard as a rock, "
"immense strength, and a simple and honest nature"

#. animal.csv: Stone Armored Bear
msgid "ANIMAL_6_NAME"
msgstr "Stone Armored Bear"

#. animal.csv: A majestic spiritual beast galloping across tho...
msgid "ANIMAL_7_DESC"
msgstr ""
