#. animal.csv: Wind Speed Horse
msgid "ANIMAL_7_NAME"
msgstr "Wind Speed Horse"

#. animal.csv: A fire-attribute spiritual beast in the Lava Vo...
msgid "ANIMAL_8_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A fire-attribute spiritual beast in the Lava Volcano, with scales red as "
"fire, able to swim in magma and spit flames"

#. animal.csv: Lava Lizard
msgid "ANIMAL_8_NAME"
msgstr "Lava Lizard"

#. animal.csv: A highly poisonous creature from the Foggy Swam...
msgid "ANIMAL_9_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A highly poisonous creature from the Foggy Swamp, with colorful body "
"patterns, able to release deadly poisonous gas, skilled at hiding"

#. animal.csv: Poisonous Miasma Frog
msgid "ANIMAL_9_NAME"
msgstr "Poisonous Miasma Frog"
